'' RUN: __CALLER_LINE__ / __CALLER_FILE__ as parameter defaults are the CALLER'S line and file --
'' a free procedure, a member, and a written argument that overrides the default. Outside a
'' default it is the line of the statement it is in. __TIKO_CALLER_LOCATION__ is defined.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/caller-location.tiko -o tests/codegen/callerloc.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/callerloc.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: first 14 caller-location.tiko
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: second 15 caller-location.tiko
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: given 99 caller-location.tiko
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: box 18
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: own 19
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: defined
